{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-90","title":{"zh":"未知舰船","en":"Unknown Vessels"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.90","chapters":2,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]恒星系中侦测到的舰队似乎是某种目的不明的跨星系远航舰队的一部分。他们没有采取任何有敌意的举动，也没有任何显而易见的重型武器。然而他们似乎完全缄默不语，我们无法从他们当中获取任何信号。我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]相信他们可以从我们拾获的只言片语中翻译他们的语言，当然这可能要花好长时间。","en":"The vessels detected in the [This.System.GetName] system seem to be part of some sort of expedition across the galaxy, with purposes unknown. They have not made any hostile moves, nor is there any heavy weaponry in evidence. However, they have been fairly clos"},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"游牧民首次接触：2个事件及阶段衔接。","en":"游牧民 first contact: 2 events and the stage hand-off."},"sources":["events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:1164-1251","common/first_contact/01_first_contact_space_fauna_and_NPCs.txt:415-452"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-critters-90.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.90","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.95","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：nomad_stage_2(难度7)","en":"Stage: nomad_stage_2 (difficulty 7)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-90.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"first_contact_critters.70.A"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.90","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"未知舰船","en":"Unknown Vessels"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]恒星系中侦测到的舰队似乎是某种目的不明的跨星系远航舰队的一部分。他们没有采取任何有敌意的举动，也没有任何显而易见的重型武器。然而他们似乎完全缄默不语，我们无法从他们当中获取任何信号。我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]相信他们可以从我们拾获的只言片语中翻译他们的语言，当然这可能要花好长时间。","en":"The vessels detected in the [This.System.GetName] system seem to be part of some sort of expedition across the galaxy, with purposes unknown. They have not made any hostile moves, nor is there any heavy weaponry in evidence. However, they have been fairly closed-mouthed, and we have been unable to pick up many signals from them. Our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] are confident that they will be able to translate their language eventually from the scraps we pick up. However, this may take quite some time."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact_critters.70.A","label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.95","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-90.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：nomad_stage_2(难度7)","en":"Stage: nomad_stage_2 (difficulty 7)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-90"}],"terminal":false,"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":false,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"令人恼火。","en":"Troubling."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"蜂巢外的这些东西的行为确实很奇怪。","en":"The actions of those outside the hive are indeed strange."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"我们怎么才能彻底了解有机体。","en":"How can we fathom the ways of organic life?"},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]}]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt","line":1163},"names":{"This.System.GetName":{"zh":"这个","en":"nearby","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现附近恒星系的名称。","en":"In the game, the name of the nearby star system appears here."}}}},{"id":"first_contact_critters.95","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"游牧民","en":"The Nomads"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们成功地破解了神秘的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]语言。我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]被难住了好长时间，直到一次他们开始向我们的大致方向上广播时才取得了突破。广播的内容是一条欢迎讯息，其中他们自称为“那马里安”。看来他们现在愿意与我们交流了。","en":"We have managed to decipher the language of the mysterious [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. Our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] remained stumped for quite some time, and a breakthrough was only made once they began broadcasting what turns out to be a welcome message identifying them as the \"Namarians\" in our general direction. It appears that they are now eager to talk to us."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/60299e8ce2b337a17e5b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ON_SCREEN","label":{"zh":"显示在屏幕上。","en":"On screen."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],